<p>Lashes out at the target with three quick punches that each deal <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">61%, 74%, 84%, 92%, 100%</acronym> damage.</p><p>Earns one combo point. If your talent level is 4 or greater, this instead earns one combo point per blow that connects.</p>